This source tree is a generic library for Atlassian GitHub Copilot
marketplace listings and plugins (canvas extensions and related CLI
plugin packages). It is not a single-product codebase. Individual
plugins (for example jira-sprint-dashboard) live under plugins/ and
extensions/ and may be added over time.

